s, underscore, hyphen or @, at most %d characters). Nothing was saved.'=>'Lokal yang anda tambah tidak sah: gunakan kod lokal WordPress seperti ll_CC (huruf, digit, garis bawah, tanda sempang atau @, paling banyak %d aksara). Tiada apa-apa disimpan.','Settings saved.'=>'Tetapan disimpan.','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'Jika ini dihidupkan, menyahpasang juga memadam identiti tapak ini. Lesen berbayar yang dikaitkan dengan tapak ini tidak dapat dipulihkan secara automatik selepas itu; anda perlu menghubungi sokongan Babilim di %s untuk mendapatkannya semula.','Babilim is set to erase this site\'s identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Babilim ditetapkan untuk memadam identiti tapak ini apabila pemalam dipadam. Lesen berbayar yang dikaitkan dengan tapak ini tidak dapat dipulihkan secara automatik; anda perlu menghubungi sokongan Babilim di %s. Untuk mengekalkan identiti, tekan Batal, nyahtandakan "Padam semua data Babilim semasa nyahpasang" dalam tetapan Babilim, dan nyahaktifkan semula. Nyahaktifkan juga?','%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'%1$d tapak dalam rangkaian ini ditetapkan untuk memadam identiti Babilim mereka apabila pemalam dipadam. Lesen berbayar yang dikaitkan dengan tapak tersebut tidak dapat dipulihkan secara automatik; anda perlu menghubungi sokongan Babilim di %2$s. Untuk mengekalkan identiti, tekan Batal, nyahtandakan "Padam semua data Babilim semasa nyahpasang" dalam tetapan Babilim setiap tapak, dan nyahaktifkan semula. Nyahaktifkan juga?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Rangkaian ini mempunyai terlalu banyak tapak untuk disemak satu demi satu, dan sebahagiannya mungkin ditetapkan untuk memadam identiti Babilim mereka apabila pemalam dipadam. Lesen berbayar yang dikaitkan dengan tapak sedemikian tidak dapat dipulihkan secara automatik; anda perlu menghubungi sokongan Babilim di %s. Untuk mengekalkan identiti tersebut, tekan Batal, nyahtanda "Padam semua data Babilim semasa nyahpasang" dalam tetapan Babilim setiap tapak, dan nyahaktifkan sekali lagi. Nyahaktifkan juga?','Open Babilim settings'=>'Buka tetapan Babilim','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim tidak dapat mengesahkan tapak ini, jadi tiada apa-apa dimuat turun atau dipasang.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Perkhidmatan tidak dapat mencapai tapak anda. Tembok api, pemalam keselamatan atau peraturan hos mungkin menyekat permintaan; sila benarkan permintaan ke /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Tapak anda mengambil masa terlalu lama untuk menjawab. Sila 